  "body": "The test [147.html](https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/old-tests/submission/Opera/script_scheduling/147.html) can only pass if scripts are executed only *after* all the children of the document fragment they came from are inserted into the document, not just at the time of their insertion. This behaviour does not seem to be specified.\r\n\r\nGecko and Chrome both pass that test, Safari doesn't, I don't know about Edge.",
